                            	  2892: UpdateMode0Demo_Sub1:
                            	  2893:     ; For each save slot:
                            	  2894:     ;   If file B is uncommitted and valid, then
                            	  2895:     ;     Copy file B to file A (also marks file B committed)
                            	  2896:     ;   If file A's static markers are wrong or file is invalid, then
                            	  2897:     ;     Format file A
                            	  2898:     ;
                            	  2899:     ; TODO: This is also mode 1 submode 0 init.
