02:0003C8B2 0003C8BE        	  6994:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C8B6 0003C934        	  6995:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
