02:0003DC44 674E            	  9659:     beq  _L_z04_Manhandla_CheckCollisions_Exit
02:0003DC46 4EB90004BB42    	  9660:     jsr     ResetShoveInfo
                            	  9661:     ; Don't let the base die on its own.
