                            	  7522:     ; We want to handle "enemies from the edges of the screen".
                            	  7523:     ;
                            	  7524:     ; So, if not in UW, or "enemies from edges" attribute is clear,
                            	  7525:     ; or the object is (zora, fire, armos, whirlwind), or any object
                            	  7526:     ; that does not spawn with a cloud (type >= $53);
                            	  7527:     ; 
                            	  7528:     ; then go initialize the object.
                            	  7529:     ;
